  "content": "<h1>暗潮</h1><p><strong>模组简介</strong></p><p>在副手装备钻石铲即可化身人鱼！</p><p><em>支持服务端安装。只需在服务器安装此模组，客户端无需安装也可生效。</em></p><p>由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗黑RPG</a>原班人马打造（若想体验完整RPG内容，可下载<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗黑RPG整合包</a>体验任务与角色扮演玩法）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>核心功能</h2><p>（以下特性将大幅提升你的原版体验）</p><p>在副手栏放置水桶并输入指令<strong>/trigger breathe</strong>，即可获得水下呼吸、夜视与速泳效果</p><p>效果持续5分钟，可重复激活</p><h2>起源兼容</h2><p>水生系<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">起源</a>角色（如鱼灵）将受益于此模组——现在你可以在陆地上行走而不会受到伤害。效果结束后只需重返水中再次激活即可。<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/968/screenshot-2025-03-27-211934-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/969/2025-03-27_21-21-11-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/970/2025-03-27_21-21-36-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即搭建服务器与好友同乐！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">